            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "Special Containment Procedures:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": " Foundation containment of SCP-9935 has, since initial containment in 1920, required a large-scale misinformation campaign targeting available public records regarding SCP-9935, its participants, and Bruce Park. The game is ongoing, and is being played currently."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "p",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "element",
          "name": "strong",
          "attributes": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "Description:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": " SCP-9935 is an anomalous baseball game between the Indianapolis Hoosiers and the Washington Nationals"
        },
        {
          "kind": "anchor",
          "id": "fnref:1"
        },
        {
          "kind": "element",
          "name": "sup",
          "attributes": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "kind": "element",
              "name": "a",
              "attributes": [
                [
                  "href",
                  "#fn:1"
                ]
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": "1"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": " that began on October 5th, 1889 and is still ongoing. Neither team has scored a run since the original game became tied in the 35th inning. Both teams folded before the start of the next season"
        },
        {
          "kind": "anchor",
          "id": "fnref:2"
        },
        {
          "kind": "element",
          "name": "sup",
          "attributes": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "kind": "element",
              "name": "a",
              "attributes": [
                [
                  "href",
                  "#fn:2"
                ]
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": "2"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "p",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Jack Glasscock"
        },
        {
          "kind": "anchor",
          "id": "fnref:3"
        },
        {
          "kind": "element",
          "name": "sup",
          "attributes": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "kind": "element",
              "name": "a",
              "attributes": [
                [
                  "href",
                  "#fn:3"
                ]
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": "3"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": ", the Hoosiers shortstop and team captain, provided the following account of the early innings."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "blockquote",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "element",
          "name": "p",
          "attributes": [],
